{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"836f7d200e48d24579315e5c0f4c195805231bb7c06777b7a3567c391f6945c4","digest":{"component_or_area":"rebar._store.sync — union merge recovery","key_entities":["src/rebar/_store/sync.py","_union_merge","_recover_merge_abort","_merge_abort_named_paths","_untracked_overwrite_paths","tests/unit/test_store_sync_reconverge.py","reconverge-quarantine","git checkout","git merge origin/tickets","git status --porcelain","compact_txn"],"problem_keywords":["merge abort","local changes","tracked files","reconverge","store sync","deletions","modifications","git merge"],"propositions":["Reconverge union merge aborts when tracked files have working-tree changes (deletions or modifications), stranding local ticket commits and blocking advancement.","The recovery handler must detect the 'Your local changes to the following files would be overwritten by merge' abort signature, parse the named paths, and restore deletions from HEAD via git checkout while quarantining modifications before restoring.","Worktree modifications are byte-for-byte copied to the shared reconverge-quarantine directory before restore to preserve local changes across the merge retry.","A single merge retry after path restoration completes the union merge; genuine content conflicts (both sides committed different content) still abort, keep local, and hint fsck-recover."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787317387996254001,"uuid":"5590451a-d291-4dd9-8a70-36df5b70991e"}